            </note>
            <note corresp="#d59-f2" n="1" xml:id="d59-f2-content">
                <p>NSAM No. 88, addressed to the Secretary of Defense, was a request for suggestions
                    concerning U.S. training for Latin American armed forces. (Ibid., NSAM 88)</p>
